# Frontend environment. Copy to .env.local for local development.
#
# Leave BLANK for production: the SPA is served by FastAPI from the same
# origin, so a relative /api/v1 path is correct and no CORS config is needed.
#
# Set this only when running `npm run dev` against a backend on another host.
# The Vite dev server already proxies /api to 127.0.0.1:8000, so the common
# local case needs nothing here either.
#
# NEVER put an API key, token or AWS credential in this file. Anything with a
# VITE_ prefix is inlined into the JavaScript bundle and is public.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
